[h2]Build 0.9.35[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Arms no longer grab items they were not pointed at. A stockpile zone at the gripper now only counts the cell the gripper reaches, not the whole zone (which could wrap round the arm). Shelves and rows of shelves work as before.
[*]Loaders only pass on items lying under the arm when a belt actually ends at the arm, so a machine's spilled output or a pawn's drop under an arm is no longer put on the belt.
[/list]
